          "meaning": "to time-honoured, Brahma's, abode, journeyed to.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.34.5",
      "label": "1.34.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "कस्यचित्त्वथ कालस्य कुशनाभस्य धीमतः |\nजज्ञे परमधर्मिष्ठो गाधिरित्येव नामतः",
      "iast": "kasyacit tu atha kālasya kuśanābhasya dhīmataḥ |\njajñe parama dharmiṣṭho gādhiḥ iti eva nāmataḥ",
      "translation": "\"Then after some time that highly intellectual Kushanaabha begot a supremely righteous son known by the name Gaadhi.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "atha kasyacit kaalasya tu",
          "iast": "atha kasyacit kālasya tu",
          "devanagari": "अथ कस्यचित् कालस्य तु",
          "meaning": "then, after some, of time, but",
