          "meaning": "to me, earlier, born, sister, also, even - she is there",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "R^iciike pratipaaditaa",
          "iast": "ṛcīke pratipāditā",
          "devanagari": "ऋचीके प्रतिपादिता",
          "meaning": "to sage Ruchika, proposed to [given in marriage.]",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 10
        }
      ]
