          "iast": "himavantam upa āśritā",
          "devanagari": "हिमवन्तं उप आश्रिता",
          "meaning": "Himavanta, [Himalayan mountains,] takes shelter [while flowing.]",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
    },
