      "label": "1.34.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "एषा राम ममोत्पत्तिः स्वस्य वंशस्य कीर्तिता |\nदेशस्य च महाबाहो यन्मां त्वं परिपृच्छसि",
      "iast": "eṣā rāma mama utpattiḥ svasya vaṃśasya kīrtitā |\ndeśasya ca mahābāho yan mām tvam paripṛcchasi",
      "translation": "\"Oh, dextrous Rama, this is all about my dynasty, my province on which we are presently camping namely the riverbanks of Sona, and about my birth, and thus everything is narrated as you have asked me.",
